<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  <p>
    Chef 360 Push Jobs replaces the legacy Chef Push Jobs feature. It adds a
    build step, "Force chef-client run (Chef 360 Courier)", that submits a job
    instance to the Chef 360 Courier orchestrator API to run <code>chef-client</code>
    on one or more managed nodes, then polls the Courier state service for completion.
  </p>
</div>
